{"summary":"Search for hidden objects scattered around hand-drawn worlds!","description":"Join Clicky on a new, whimsical journey in Hidden Through Time 2: Discovery! This delightful 2D hidden object game will capture your heart with its playful spirit, cozy ambiance, and endless discoveries. Dive into beautifully illustrated worlds, searching for elusive hidden objects scattered throughout—and unlock even more as you explore.\n\nStory Mode\nVenture through four enchanted eras, uncovering items as you progress through each stage’s story. Track down each hidden object to advance and reveal each era’s tale—who knows what mysteries await in the next chapter?\n\nReality-Shift\nHarness the new Reality Shift feature to shape your adventure with the flow of time! Toggle between Day and Night, Summer and Winter, exploring each map in two unique states.\n\nReady to dive in? Set off on this magical quest through time, where adventure is only a Click(y) away!","esrbNotes":"Fantasy Violence, Mild Blood, Alcohol Reference","pegiNotes":"Implied Violence","iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/RdL6dcTADFw?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/NL-G2eXcIX-uQhzkzvLdInLkpG-iNIXvnNpEe8g5WckfBlUsYnKOj2rjl1qWWj4tq85Fhw6MdJ_q74jSFY29","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/dTkMsG7I4328ZRAnKKcuLzy0eCT6vQZ2XbHeZ8bJdlWDnt6M9ZtStE7F-_IyRypmsg7oUbP19Mhf5kxSMb8","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_rRQmqrKSKNiqQ7qYl4R3No_xSOW92qBHveAzwS3W89I8DaIwEmyzQ0qcwvqAnun8m8gBZURHc3wMeSftKi9Mg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/i7yQFueDcZgr-K9dvUd0varnp8kP1zv7HF8LDlRY64ORjjclaVG0jkCSjCMHkN8de2IH3vx5g4mSTzibXnIlqg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/6DsA_EjkJWk1SO7HitmfF32WZdLJmpDnatm__y8Riht-Udvy8JDBL3qqKQjiUgTptTT18Q_1NQiF-L6DgjvnBFk","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/58eCGAEAqvIuw632ehvfWW9fNe4Gac0nE_mAP6xMoWYcgRidHT3_lDBHsw7zOMHubd3MC01GpqXMbMGOgRip","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/wZAioJO6i4LBw4a97x